   "evidence": "Its proof only combines `inner_mgradient` with `ContinuousLinearMap.mvfderiv_comp_apply`. `Gradient/ChainRule.lean:83` already holds the analogous `inner_mgradient_comp` for compositions g \u2218 \u03c6, but there is no lemma for linear functionals.",
